[center][size=5][b]Trading Post Mission Filter[/b][/size]
Pick a mission type and the space trading post terminal keeps offering it.[/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
The yellow terminal at outer space trading posts offers a mix of asteroid mining, salvage, biohazard cleanup and package delivery missions. This mod lets you pick one type and the terminal will keep offering it by changing the mission weights accordingly. Requested by [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/MadMax1337]MadMax1337[/url].

[b]Options[/b]
The installer asks which mission type the board should offer.
[list]
[*][b]Package delivery only[/b][/*]
[*][b]Asteroid mining only[/b][/*]
[*][b]Salvage only[/b][/*]
[*][b]Slime cleanup only[/b][/*]
[/list]

[b]Install[/b]
Use a mod manager (Amethyst or Vortex): install the zip and pick one option in the installer. Without a manager, unzip it, open the folder for the option you want and copy everything inside it into [b]GAMEDATA/MODS/Trading Post Mission Filter[/b]. To switch types, reinstall and pick another; missions already on the board stay as they are, new ones follow the new choice.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Built for Forsaken[/*]
[*]Modifies [i]METADATA/SIMULATION/MISSIONS/TABLES/SPACEOUTPOSTMISSIONTABLE.MBIN[/i]. It may conflict with any other mod editing that file[/*]
[*][b].lua [/b]included so you can merge with AMUMSS [/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/trading-post-mission-filter]https://github.com/SavageCore/trading-post-mission-filter[/url]